SoftGRE on Debian
=================

Configure /etc/softgred/softgred.conf before starting softgred.service.
Use journalctl -u softgred for logs. The TCP API binds loopback by default.

Build with dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b. Build dependencies are declared in
control; runtime networking requires root, bridge/GRE/VLAN kernel support,
and ebtables. The package installs the daemon, configuration and systemd unit.

The full guide is available in docs/en_US/index.md.
